#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.3.0.rst:4
msgid "v1.3.0"
msgstr "v1.3.0"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.3.0.rst:6
msgid ""
"v1.3.0 is a big feature release: it introduces **WiFi-shield support** (the "
"**WINC1500** :class:`network.WINC` driver and the ``usocket`` socket API "
"with firmware-management tools), a new :mod:`fir` thermal-IR module, "
":mod:`sensor` white-balance / mirror / flip setters, "
":func:`sensor.skip_frames`, and ``mean`` / ``median`` / ``mode`` / "
"``midpoint`` image filters. It introduces **no breaking API changes** — "
"v1.2.0 scripts run unchanged."
msgstr ""
"v1.3.0 je veliko izdanje sa značajkama: uvodi **podršku za WiFi štit** "
"(upravljački program **WINC1500** :class:`network.WINC` i ``usocket`` socket"
" API s alatima za upravljanje ugrađenim programom), novi :mod:`fir` "
"toplinsko-IR modul, postavljače modula :mod:`sensor` za balans bijele / "
"zrcaljenje / okretanje, :func:`sensor.skip_frames` te ``mean`` / ``median`` "
"/ ``mode`` / ``midpoint`` filtre slike. Ne uvodi **nikakve promjene API-ja "
"koje narušavaju kompatibilnost** — skripte za v1.2.0 rade nepromijenjeno."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.3.0.rst:16
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Na ovoj stranici"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.3.0.rst:19
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Istaknuto"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.3.0.rst:21
msgid ""
"**WiFi shield** — WINC1500 :class:`network.WINC` (scan / connect / ifconfig)"
" and the ``usocket`` socket API (TCP/UDP, DNS, timeouts) with firmware "
"update/dump/version tools."
msgstr ""
"**WiFi štit** — WINC1500 :class:`network.WINC` (scan / connect / ifconfig) i"
" ``usocket`` socket API (TCP/UDP, DNS, istek vremena) s alatima za "
"ažuriranje/dump/verziju ugrađenog programa."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.3.0.rst:24
msgid ":mod:`fir` module — thermal-IR (MLX) sensor support."
msgstr ":mod:`fir` modul — podrška za toplinsko-IR (MLX) senzor."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.3.0.rst:25
msgid ""
"**Sensor** — ``set_whitebal()`` / ``set_hmirror()`` / ``set_vflip()`` and "
"``skip_frames()``."
msgstr ""
"**Senzor** — ``set_whitebal()`` / ``set_hmirror()`` / ``set_vflip()`` i "
"``skip_frames()``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.3.0.rst:27
msgid ""
"**Filters** — ``image.mean()`` / ``median()`` / ``mode()`` / ``midpoint()``."
msgstr ""
"**Filtri** — ``image.mean()`` / ``median()`` / ``mode()`` / ``midpoint()``\\"
" ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.3.0.rst:28
msgid ""
"**No breaking API changes** — reflash and your v1.2.0 scripts run unchanged."
msgstr ""
"**Nema promjena API-ja koje narušavaju kompatibilnost** — preflashajte i "
"vaše skripte za v1.2.0 rade nepromijenjeno."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.3.0.rst:32
msgid "New features"
msgstr "Nove značajke"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.3.0.rst:34
msgid ""
"**WiFi shield (WINC1500)** — added the :class:`network.WINC` driver (WiFi "
"scan, connect, ifconfig) and the ``usocket`` socket API: ``send()`` / "
"``recv()``, ``bind()`` / ``sendto()`` / ``recvfrom()``, ``listen()`` / "
"``accept()``, ``settimeout()`` / blocking timeouts, and DNS (with async "
"socket/DNS callbacks), plus ``winc.fw_update()`` / ``winc.fw_dump()`` / "
"``winc.fw_version()`` firmware tools and WiFi example scripts (scan, "
"connect, TCP client, DNS, NTP, MJPEG streamer)."
msgstr ""
"**WiFi štit (WINC1500)** — dodan je upravljački program "
":class:`network.WINC` (WiFi scan, connect, ifconfig) i ``usocket`` socket "
"API: ``send()`` / ``recv()``\\ , ``bind()`` / ``sendto()`` / "
"``recvfrom()``\\ , ``listen()`` / ``accept()``\\ , ``settimeout()`` / "
"blokirajući istek vremena i DNS (s asinkronim povratnim pozivima za "
"socket/DNS), uz alate za ugrađeni program ``winc.fw_update()`` / "
"``winc.fw_dump()`` / ``winc.fw_version()`` i WiFi primjere skripti (scan, "
"connect, TCP klijent, DNS, NTP, MJPEG streamer)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.3.0.rst:41
msgid ""
":mod:`fir` — added the :mod:`fir` thermal-IR module (``init`` / ``deinit`` /"
" ``read_ta`` / ``read_ir`` / ``draw_ta`` / ``draw_ir``, with internal "
"scaling/blending) and ``fir.py`` / ``fir_lcd.py`` examples."
msgstr ""
":mod:`fir` — dodan je :mod:`fir` toplinsko-IR modul (\\ ``init`` / "
"``deinit`` / ``read_ta`` / ``read_ir`` / ``draw_ta`` / ``draw_ir``\\ , s "
"internim skaliranjem/miješanjem) i primjeri ``fir.py`` / ``fir_lcd.py``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.3.0.rst:45
msgid ""
"**Sensor** — added ``sensor.set_whitebal()``, :func:`sensor.set_hmirror`, "
":func:`sensor.set_vflip`, and :func:`sensor.skip_frames` (settle the camera "
"after changing settings)."
msgstr ""
"**Senzor** — dodani su ``sensor.set_whitebal()``\\ , "
":func:`sensor.set_hmirror`\\ , :func:`sensor.set_vflip` i "
":func:`sensor.skip_frames` (ustaljivanje kamere nakon promjene postavki)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.3.0.rst:48
msgid ""
"**Image filters** — added ``image.mean()``, ``image.median()``, "
"``image.mode()``, and ``image.midpoint(ksize, bias=)``."
msgstr ""
"**Filtri slike** — dodani su ``image.mean()``\\ , ``image.median()``\\ , "
"``image.mode()`` i ``image.midpoint(ksize, bias=)``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.3.0.rst:50
msgid ""
"Added a rewritten BLE driver/example and an MLX IR-table generator tool."
msgstr ""
"Dodan je prerađeni BLE upravljački program/primjer i alat za generiranje MLX"
" IR tablice."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.3.0.rst:53
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Ostale promjene i poboljšanja"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.3.0.rst:55
msgid ""
"Reorganized the example scripts into numbered, Arduino-style topic "
"directories (01-Basics, etc.) and added save / GIF / MJPEG examples; added a"
" \"copy color\" auto-threshold color-blob tool to OpenMV IDE."
msgstr ""
"Primjeri skripti reorganizirani su u numerirane direktorije tema u Arduino "
"stilu (01-Basics itd.) i dodani su primjeri za save / GIF / MJPEG; u OpenMV "
"IDE dodan je alat za automatski prag mrlje boje \"copy color\"."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.3.0.rst:60
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Ispravci grešaka"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.3.0.rst:62
msgid ""
"Fixed the WINC1500 ``gethostbyname`` / DNS IP byte order, ``fw_update()`` "
"firmware verification, and shipped an updated single WINC firmware image."
msgstr ""
"Ispravljeni su WINC1500 ``gethostbyname`` / DNS redoslijed bajtova IP "
"adrese, verifikacija ugrađenog programa u ``fw_update()`` te isporučena "
"ažurirana jedinstvena slika WINC ugrađenog programa."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.3.0.rst:66
msgid "Hardware and board support"
msgstr "Hardver i podrška za ploče"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.3.0.rst:68
msgid "**WiFi shield** — WINC1500 (firmware 19.4.4)."
msgstr "**WiFi štit** — WINC1500 (firmware 19.4.4)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.3.0.rst:69
msgid ":mod:`fir` — MLX thermal-IR sensor."
msgstr ":mod:`fir` — MLX toplinsko-IR senzor."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.3.0.rst:72
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "Promjene API-ja koje narušavaju kompatibilnost"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.3.0.rst:74
msgid ""
"v1.3.0 introduces **no breaking Python API changes**. Scripts that ran on "
"v1.2.0 run unchanged on v1.3.0 — just reflash the firmware. (The WINC1500 "
"WiFi/``usocket`` stack and the :mod:`fir` thermal module are new in this "
"release; their internal API was finalized within v1.3.0.)"
msgstr ""
"v1.3.0 ne uvodi **nikakve promjene Python API-ja koje narušavaju "
"kompatibilnost**\\ . Skripte koje su radile na v1.2.0 rade nepromijenjeno na"
" v1.3.0 — samo preflashajte ugrađeni program. (WINC1500 WiFi/\\ ``usocket`` "
"stog i :mod:`fir` toplinski modul novi su u ovom izdanju; njihov interni API"
" finaliziran je unutar v1.3.0.)"
